  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fBlf/29",
  "contentHtml": "<p>따로 촬영된 영상은 없습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eadb46fa0ecb55ddf37c9c60b1dd64c5be1e2087\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eadb46fa0ecb55ddf37c9c60b1dd64c5be1e2087\" data-origin-width=\"628\" data-origin-height=\"628\"></div><p>드론으로 촬영한 재과만 톡톡 행사 단체 사진입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db2df04457e991557c2640b6103a3279be7e7e9f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/db2df04457e991557c2640b6103a3279be7e7e9f\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvslb1sn9ok1ki4zn4xsehxw0@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rvslb1sn9ok1ki4zn4xsehxw0/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33287162588&amp;signature=ZoCn5FPGO8CMetLqd33To095KsI%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvslb1sn9ok1ki4zn4xsehxw0?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2c2xiMXNuOW9rMWtpNHpuNHhzZWh4dzAiLCJ0aWQiOiI5ZDkyYWFkZi00NmUyLTQzYWYtOTYwMi1iMDhlYzk5NGNhNDQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODc4MjN9.yICRVlNB7eL9O1jKEIuLE0FAuKGKCX_Gz6ECsnX6o3TPDZPGf93oUIoIdtdW0em6W5rtaStK7DvgMJ3JVdhUvg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>광수중학교에서 재과만 톡톡 28회 오프라인 모임 과 전국 과학교사 연수회가 열렸습니다.</p><p>과학교사K 로 유명한 김요섭 선생님이&#160;꾸미신 최점단 과학실을 구경할 수 있었고,</p><p>전국에 있는 선생님들과 만나 강의 및 다양한 교류의 시간을 보낼 수 있었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>누가 시켜서 하는게 아니라,&#160;</p><p>자발적으로 하는 행사라 너무 즐겁고 행복한 시간이었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>예산이 부족하다고 했더니</p><p>일부 선생님들이 자발적으로 준비해 오신 간식들이 넘쳐 나서, 나중에는 싸가지고 가셨다는...</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5914521db7f8170c69e9cdcac1cf5819de5aa09d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"424\" height=\"318\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5914521db7f8170c69e9cdcac1cf5819de5aa09d\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2db315e08085e16f8a00353381d3ec246b70a053\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"408\" height=\"378\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2db315e08085e16f8a00353381d3ec246b70a053\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1001\"></div><p>같은 생각을 가진 과학선생님들이 함께 한다는 것 만으로도 행복한 시간이었습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>지식나눔 시간에 서로의 노하우를 적극적으로 나누시는 모습에 감동. 배워야 할게 많네요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebc9b455d4aad16501ceb884f563b7baa54aead6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ebc9b455d4aad16501ceb884f563b7baa54aead6\" data-origin-width=\"218\" data-origin-height=\"215\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/89c9f6f07b960f55a92a42024c53755d9e82ff68\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/89c9f6f07b960f55a92a42024c53755d9e82ff68\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9889d0b186ca13be4c0c6c7414902fd915f8ae77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9889d0b186ca13be4c0c6c7414902fd915f8ae77\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><p>자세한 내용은 정리를 못하겠네요. ㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>첨단 과학실 모습은 따라 다니는 드론 이용해서 동영상으로 촬영해 두었습니다.</p><p>살짝 엿보심이...</p><p>영상을 따라가 보시면 디테일한 내부 모습을 볼 수 있습니다.&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/D5NBhISHIZw\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/D5NBhISHIZw</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D5NBhISHIZw\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dLuXqK/hyXpDM3Smw/Jf3yxAV7jYzz6rNhP3zYF0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bzSDuS/hyXpw1uJP0/lgf8m0d879ZaqNZ1cmy9jk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/D5NBhISHIZw\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>운영진 및 함께 하신 선생님들 뒷풀이</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bad9dfa1db2680e7012ccca58c633d150469b2f5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bad9dfa1db2680e7012ccca58c633d150469b2f5\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
